# Copy to `.env` for local dev; `pnpm dev` / `pnpm console` load this
# automatically via Node's `--env-file-if-exists=.env`. The file is
# gitignored — never commit secrets.

# Required for `pnpm dev` — Hindsight uses Anthropic for memory extraction.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# OpenAI — Hindsight's `text-embedding-3-small` calls, plus voice TTS/STT
# when running `pnpm test:record` against pipeline.integration.test.ts.
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...

# fal.ai — image generation fixtures captured by `pnpm test:record`.
# FAL_API_KEY=...

# Venice.ai — image generation fixtures captured by `pnpm test:record`
# (native /image/generate endpoint, used by the `venice` image_provider_type).
# VENICE_API_KEY=VENICE_INFERENCE_KEY_...

# OpenRouter — xAI / Grok fixture captured by `pnpm test:record`.
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-...

# Daytona — managed sandbox backend; fixture captured by `pnpm test:record`.
# DAYTONA_API_KEY=dty_...
# DAYTONA_API_URL=https://app.daytona.io/api
# DAYTONA_ORGANIZATION_ID=...
